WEBVTT

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:03.630
PAREO?

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:05.920
PAREO!

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.540
Not here, either.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.250
Dammit, CHU2...

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.040
WHERE in Kamogawa?!

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.880
Let's circle back around, LOCK.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.250
To the train station?

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:16.750
Everywhere! The whole city!

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:20.630
M..Masuki-san, how about we try asking someone?

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:21.630
What?!

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:22.750
Asking someone!

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:25.750
If we ask a few students,
we might be able to find her!

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:32.540
You're pretty smart, ain'tcha?

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.880
Initial, I can't hide this passion in my heart

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:45.630
A sudden urge, and emotion flies from my fingertips!

00:00:55.540 --> 00:01:00.290
On that fateful day, I was neither a child nor an adult

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:05.290
Gazing unwaveringly at my dream and nothing else

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:10.330
Feelings overflowing in the night, flaring and flickering

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:15.380
I gathered my courage and set out on a journey

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:20.710
Initial, it came bubbling to the surface

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:25.500
My entire body shivering with emotion

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:30.380
Why do I keep staring up at the endless night sky

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:36.250
And crying out the same words over and over?

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:40.130
Although I tend to get distracted

00:01:40.130 --> 00:01:42.960
And sometimes caught up in a haze

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:47.420
The treasure is right before my very eyes

00:01:47.630 --> 00:01:50.080
From that initial moment onwards

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:52.500
I've felt the pulsing of the stars

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:57.170
When you whip your fingers across the strings

00:01:57.170 --> 00:02:00.170
Even now it makes my heart flutter

00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:02.040
I love you!

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:08.420
PAREO No Longer Exists

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:11.330
Exams are finally over!

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:13.290
Clubs are already starting up, though.

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:15.170
Talk about busy!

00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:16.250
Excuse me...

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:20.960
Either of you know PAREO?

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:27.540
They ran away from us...

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:29.630
What're they freakin' out for?

00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:33.170
Those girls looked like middle schoolers.
There could be a middle school nearby...!

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:34.080
Hey!

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:37.880
Which school do you go to?

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:39.250
Masuki-san!

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:48.250
Pardon us...

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:50.250
Anyone mind if we pay a visit...?

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:51.790
Forget about that. Let's go!

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:53.380
But this is trespassing!

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:56.330
We'll be fine as long as we drop by
the faculty room and get permission, right?

00:02:56.790 --> 00:02:58.790
Wait up!

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:01.210
Masuki-san!
C-can I help you?

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:03.130
We aren't suspicious, I swear!

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:04.460
Does PAREO go to school here?

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:06.210
"PAREO"?

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:11.130
U-um, she's a second-year middle schooler
who plays in our band.

00:03:11.130 --> 00:03:14.960
Her hair changes colors, but she ties it
into two ponytails right around here.

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:18.290
She's about... this tall, and she's very cute!

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:20.460
She's also good at sewing!

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:21.710
A band...?

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:23.330
Do we know anyone like that...?

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:24.830
Here's a picture.

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:26.750
Oh my god, how cute!

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:28.420
Adorable!

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:29.960
Do you mind?

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:34.500
Nyubara-san...?

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:34.830
What?!

00:03:34.830 --> 00:03:35.330
You're kidding!
What?!

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:35.750
You're kidding!

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:37.500
"Nyubara-san"...?

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:41.580
A girl in our class named Reona Nyubara-san.

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:45.170
She's smart, serious, and doesn't talk much.

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:48.330
She's the class rep and
vice president of the Craft Club.

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:49.630
PAREO-san...?

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:50.670
"Doesn't talk much"...?

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:52.420
Could it really be her?

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:54.170
I barely recognize her...

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:57.750
NYUBARA

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:00.670
So this is PAREO's house, eh?

00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:02.920
I can't help but worry...

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:05.290
If we've got the wrong person,
we'll just keep on searching.

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:11.080
Not once has PAREO-san mentioned
her family or her school.

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:13.040
What if she gets in trouble...?

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.040
Should we leave?

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:18.290
No way.

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:20.920
We've got to sit down and get things sorted out.

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:23.040
Right.

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:25.790
Huh?

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:27.710
Aren't you...?

00:04:30.210 --> 00:04:31.960
Please don't look at me...

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:34.540
W-wait a minute!

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:35.380
I'll catch her!
W-wait a minute!

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:38.170
Um, excuse me...!

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:42.790
She's freakin' fast!

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:43.750
PAREO!

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:45.630
You're mistaken!

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:50.830
Hold on!

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:05.380
PAREO-san...

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:09.380
You're mistaken.

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:12.040
But... you ARE her, aren't you?

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:15.080
Your name's Reona Nyubara, right?

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:18.380
Some girls from your school told us. 

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:20.960
When we showed 'em a picture of PAREO,
they were almost positive.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.710
I'm sorry if we overstepped.

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:25.330
It's alright...

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:27.250
Did they say anything about her?

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:29.920
Yes. They called her cute.

00:05:31.170 --> 00:05:32.330
I'm glad.

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:36.170
Unlike me, PAREO IS cute...

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:39.710
Well then, your new class representative
is Nyubara-san.

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:41.380
Let's have a productive school year.

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:41.380
Reona Nyubara

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:43.000
I'll do my best...

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:47.830
Nyubara-san!

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:49.830
That was awesome!

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:55.460
I heard Nyubara-san's going to play in
the basketball game this Sunday!

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:56.750
Wow...!

00:05:56.750 --> 00:06:00.580
She amazing, isn't she?
Good grades, pretty, and friendly!

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:05.420
I'm home...

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:11.710
Reona-chan,

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:11.710
I'm working late again tonight.

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:11.710
Go ahead and eat dinner without me.

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:11.710
-Mom

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:18.380
Shuwarin ☆ Drea~min

00:06:18.380 --> 00:06:19.670
Shuwarin ☆ Drea~min

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:38.710
Did it record the whole thing...?

