00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:54.750
Chiyu...?

00:06:57.790 --> 00:07:01.000
Keyboardist audition?

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:07.290
Stop!

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:12.040
The fact that you've mastered it
in a matter of days is impressive.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:12.920
But...

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:15.080
Try not to hold back next time.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:15.880
Huh?

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:18.000
I don't need an honor student.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.630
Even YOU must be getting tired
of that schtick, right?

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:29.630
Thanks for inviting me!

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:36.500
How cute!

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:37.920
These are adorable! 

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:39.130
Very PasuPare-ish...

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:42.420
Chiyu! Do these clothes belong to you?

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:44.960
No, they were delivered by the department store.

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:46.920
My mom must've ordered them without asking.

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:48.330
Wow...

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:51.750
More importantly, you are to call me
"CHU2" from now on!

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:52.670
"CHU2"...?

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:54.500
It's my producer name.

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:56.540
Producer...

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:57.880
How cool...

00:07:58.380 --> 00:07:59.920
Which one would you like to try on?

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:01.290
What?! I can't!

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:03.830
Clothes like this ought to be worn by
someone much cuter than me...

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:06.380
I don't exactly appreciate what you're implying.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:08.960
Sorry...

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:11.420
What do you REALLY want?

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:14.750
The truth is...

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:24.210
You look fantastic!

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:25.210
Think so?

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:26.250
Sure!

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:29.420
From this day forth, your name is "PAREO."

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:30.380
Like the swimsuit?

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:33.080
"One who conceals her emotions and desires."

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:36.130
It's the sort of theme that came to mind
when I saw you.

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:38.330
PAREO...

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:41.290
Let's change the world together!

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:49.960
Of course, CHU2-sama!

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:55.710
PAREO?

00:08:55.710 --> 00:08:57.580
PAREO no longer exists.

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:01.210
Wait a minute... Do you plan on quittin' RAS?

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:04.880
PAREO isn't necessary in order for RAS to perform.

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:06.710
Without you, we aren't cute enough!

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:07.380
Huh?!

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:12.000
When it comes to RAS, your cuteness stands out
next to CHU2's music and Rei's voice.

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:13.750
It's part of our charm!

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:16.040
A-anything else...?

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:18.130
Oh, right...

00:09:18.130 --> 00:09:21.420
Your fingers move crazy fast
across the keyboard...

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:23.750
And the way you dance
while playing is adorable...

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:25.080
And your legs are so long...

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:29.040
Y'see... PAREO's cuteness knows no bounds.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:31.790
Like she's chasing the ideal image of cuteness.

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:34.790
Even I like cute things, y'know?

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:37.170
It'd be awfully boring if you weren't around.

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:42.040
Like I said, PAREO's gone...

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:44.420
Now what?

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:47.250
Didn't you say you were going to convince her?!

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:48.290
Y-yeah...

00:09:49.670 --> 00:09:52.290
Everyone would be sad if you quit.

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:53.630
Rei was concerned about you.

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.580
CHU2's waiting for you, too!

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:57.290
Don't lie to me.

00:09:57.670 --> 00:10:00.130
Well, I didn't exactly ask her how she felt...

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:03.630
Don't quit, PAREO.

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:06.790
It's too late.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:07.830
But why?

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:12.170
I assumed having PAREO around to keep
Chiyu company would be enough,

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:14.210
even if everyone else disappeared.

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:19.540
PAREO lost her entire reason for existing.

00:10:23.460 --> 00:10:26.040
H-hold on a minute!

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:29.130
RAS is only RAS with FIVE members!

00:10:29.130 --> 00:10:32.960
LAYER-san and Masuki-san and CHU2-san
and me and PAREO-san!

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:35.540
One of us going missin' means RAS is done for!

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:38.710
PAREO-san...

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:43.000
Don't you enjoy playing in a band
with the rest of us?

00:10:44.630 --> 00:10:46.210
That's not...

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:49.250
There's nobody stronger than the five of us.

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:52.290
Each of our members has the talent
to survive on her own,

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:55.000
but when you put us together,
we make for an unbelievable band!

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:57.460
Our instruments resonate with one another.

00:10:57.460 --> 00:11:01.000
The fiery passion in our music comes from
the dedication we all share.

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:05.000
It's truly a thing of beauty,
and I can't help but feel lucky...

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:08.960
The fun times... Someone like ME
getting to be part of it...

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:11.920
A band who can go the distance,
pushing harder and flying higher...

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:14.670
I believe RAS is that type of band.

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:16.250
Even when things get garbled...

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:19.460
Everything will be fine as long as we
keep RAS in our hearts!

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:22.080
I'm not ready to say goodbye...

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:26.000
LOCK-san...

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:38.830
PAREO!

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:48.130
CHU2-sama!

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:49.670
PAREO...

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:50.880
Why...?

00:11:51.880 --> 00:11:53.380
Sorry...

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:57.000
I went overboard.

00:11:57.540 --> 00:11:59.080
Please forgive me.

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:03.500
CHU2-sama!

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:05.290
I'm sorry for slacking off!

00:12:05.290 --> 00:12:07.130
I'm sorry for not answering your calls!

00:12:07.130 --> 00:12:09.880
I'm sorry for causing all sorts of trouble!

00:12:09.880 --> 00:12:12.080
Stop, PAREO! That hurts!

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:13.710
CHU2-sama, please forgive me!

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:14.750
I can't breathe...!
CHU2-sama, please forgive me!

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.210
CHU2-sama!

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:17.420
Shall we head home?
CHU2-sama!

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:23.380
Are you getting sleepy, CHU2-sama?

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:24.500
Feel free to take a nap.

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:26.790
No... I'm wide awake.

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:30.170
I had no clue you were
commuting from this far away...

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:37.750
In my mind, I didn't care if everyone hated me
as long as I managed to form the ultimate band.

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:42.920
But the idea that you'd rather hang out with PoPiPa...

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:47.540
The idea of growing even farther apart
from the rest of you if things continue this way...

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:49.250
It scares me.

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:52.670
I'm sorry we made you feel anxious.

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:57.210
But it seems we're all just as concerned about RAS.

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:01.580
Same for Masuki and LOCK.
It holds a special place in their hearts. 

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:05.000
RAS is precious to me, too.

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:08.880
What about you, PAREO?

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:11.330
I suppose you're right...

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:14.460
RAS is important to me. It's fun...

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:17.630
I'd like to stay with everyone for a very long time.

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:21.290
But in my heart, nobody can
possibly beat CHU2-sama!

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:23.500
No matter how extraordinary the music,

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:27.210
no one would hear it
without someone around to play it.

00:13:28.210 --> 00:13:31.330
And since I don't possess
the power to play it myself...

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:35.710
I have a lot of respect for you guys.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:38.040
CHU2-sama...

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:39.830
Thank you.

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:43.380
We prioritized stuff like practice
over everything else...

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:47.290
We've never sat down to discuss
our feelings like this before, have we?

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:52.170
From now on, let's try getting to know
more about one another

00:13:52.170 --> 00:13:54.210
and focus on getting strong together.

00:13:56.710 --> 00:14:00.670
Man... Good thing I managed to
change PAREO's mind, eh?

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:03.420
Does that mean your plan worked?

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:04.790
Like a charm!

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:06.710
You helped too, of course!

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:07.830
Of course!

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:18.460
Shouldn't they be here by now...?

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:19.670
Did we make it?!

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:20.500
Just barely.

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:22.540
Nice and warm...!

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:23.420
What...?

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:25.000
Only a few seconds left!

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:28.460
Friday, Dec. 6th

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:28.080
3... 2... 1... 

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:29.170
Saturday, Dec. 7th

00:14:29.170 --> 00:14:30.330
CHU2-sama...

00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:33.040
Happy birthday!

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:37.290
Thank goodness we got here in time!

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:38.920
Today's your birthday, right?

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:40.130
Did you forget?

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:42.580
Right this way, CHU2-sama!

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:46.500
Wha-?

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:48.080
Please wait just a moment!

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:49.580
What...? What are you doing?

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:50.710
Shh!

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:45.670
Happy birthday, CHU2.

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:49.080
Thanks for inviting me to join RAS.

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:50.790
LAYER...

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:53.920
I feel grateful for you.

00:16:53.920 --> 00:16:57.420
Thought a chance at somethin' like a band
would never come my way.

00:16:57.920 --> 00:17:00.290
As a drummer, I might not be perfect... 

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:02.920
...but I got your back.

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:05.330
Don't go gettin' discouraged, CHU2.

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:07.130
MASKING...

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:13.000
CHU2-san, I'm glad you chose
the five of us to become a band.

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:14.830
All the fun and excitement...

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:16.710
There's nothin' like it!

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:18.250
LOCK...

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:25.750
CHU2-sama... Happy birthday.

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:27.880
I love you!

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:30.080
PAREO...

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:34.380
This is unfair!

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:36.380
PAREO wrote the song, you know.

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:38.380
Planned out each part herself.

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:39.960
CHU2-sama!

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:41.290
Happy birthday.

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:42.920
You cryin' right now?

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:44.420
I am NOT crying!

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:47.670
We're sorry for worrying you.

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:49.000
Thanks for your help.

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:50.920
My apologies for the inconvenience.

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:52.210
Please, take this!

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:51.880
Nyubara Dried Fish

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:52.920
No problem!

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:53.880
Th-thank you. My grandma will be thrilled.

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:54.830
I'm glad you guys worked things out.
Th-thank you. My grandma will be thrilled.

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:55.710
Dried fish...
I'm glad you guys worked things out.
Th-thank you. My grandma will be thrilled.

00:17:55.710 --> 00:17:56.250
My family owns a specialty shop.

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:57.460
Me, too!
My family owns a specialty shop.

00:17:57.460 --> 00:17:59.040
It's nice to see all five of you.

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:01.460
After everything you did for us, it's only natural.

00:18:01.460 --> 00:18:04.580
That being said, we have
no intention of going easy on you.

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:05.420
Right!

00:18:06.170 --> 00:18:07.830
Speakin' of which...

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:10.330
Is this where you always practice?

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:11.830
Sure is!

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:15.080
Reminds me of some sorta secret hideout.
Your equipment's cool, too.

00:18:15.080 --> 00:18:17.210
If you like a grandpa collection, that is!

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:18.170
Sick burn!

00:18:18.170 --> 00:18:19.250
Grandpa?!

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:20.210
As in "old."

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:22.290
This your first time here, Massu?

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:22.880
Yeah.

00:18:22.880 --> 00:18:23.630
Mine, too.

00:18:23.630 --> 00:18:25.080
You're always welcome to visit.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:26.000
Hey!

00:18:27.170 --> 00:18:31.000
Please let me know the next time
you plan on stopping by, Masuki-san!

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.000
Why not visit 'em on your own?

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.420
Only one week left...
Why not visit 'em on your own?

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:34.500
I have no intention of letting PoPiPa catch up,
nor settling for 2nd place.
It's just...

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:36.460
I have no intention of letting PoPiPa catch up,
nor settling for 2nd place.
Showing up at PoPiPa's place alone

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:37.630
I have no intention of letting PoPiPa catch up,
nor settling for 2nd place.
out of the blue seems kind of...

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:38.080
Let's head to the studio.
out of the blue seems kind of...

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:38.790
Let's head to the studio.

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:39.670
Listen...

00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:43.580
You mind if we take a slight detour
on the way back?

00:18:45.210 --> 00:18:46.790
Now's the perfect time!

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:50.710
No! Didn't I tell you?! Showers ONLY!

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:51.920
They just drew the water, y'know.

00:18:51.920 --> 00:18:53.460
You don't want to catch a cold.

00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:55.210
Just for a little while, CHU2-sama!

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:56.630
NO!

00:18:58.670 --> 00:18:59.960
This feels great...

00:18:59.960 --> 00:19:02.460
I've always wanted to come here with you guys.

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:04.880
How lovely!

00:19:05.880 --> 00:19:06.960
I'm getting out!

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:08.420
Gotta count to 100 first.

00:19:08.420 --> 00:19:09.670
100?! WHY?!

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:11.790
To keep from getting cold, right?

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:12.790
It's a test of courage!

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:14.710
I did that a long time ago, too.

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:18.000
When I was in elementary school,
I once nearly drowned in the bathtub.

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:23.790
My mom says she noticed almost immediately
because I'd been counting out loud.

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:24.750
Thank goodness!

00:19:24.750 --> 00:19:27.170
That makes sense.
The counting suddenly stopped!

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:28.130
Scary...

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:33.380
1... 2... 3... 4...

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:35.880
3... 2... 1...
1... 2... 3... 4...

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:36.540
3... 2... 1...

00:19:36.540 --> 00:19:38.580
Wait! Why'd you go backwards?!

00:19:38.830 --> 00:19:40.460
Once more from the top.

00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:42.210
From the top?!

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:51.290
Congrats, Track and Field

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:51.290
Congrats, Dance Team

00:19:56.960 --> 00:20:02.750
Our apologies!

00:19:56.960 --> 00:20:02.750
Rankings are unavailable until

00:19:56.960 --> 00:20:02.750
the finalists are announced

00:19:56.960 --> 00:20:02.750
on 12/15 (Sun.)

00:19:58.040 --> 00:20:00.130
Just tell us what place we're in!

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:02.750
It's anyone's guess since they
started hiding the rankings...

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:05.540
Roselia's at CiRCLE, and RAS is at Dub...

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:06.420
We won't lose!

00:20:06.420 --> 00:20:10.290
Right! Let's give it our all in
the final performance of the prelims!

00:20:10.290 --> 00:20:11.500
Yeah!

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:14.330
Arisa!

00:20:15.330 --> 00:20:17.080
You sure are in a good mood...

00:20:17.080 --> 00:20:18.580
Do you want a chocolate cornet?

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:19.830
Are you nervous?

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:20.710
You feeling sick?

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:21.920
It's just...

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:25.380
When I think about this being the end, it's like...

00:20:26.710 --> 00:20:28.000
Don't worry about it!

00:20:28.000 --> 00:20:28.830
About what?

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:31.670
There's no reason to get worked up or upset!

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:34.580
Yeah. We agreed to enter the tournament together.

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:36.380
None of us are in this alone.

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:38.540
Even if we don't reach the finals...

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:41.960
It might suck, but we'll never let
our experience go to waste.

00:20:41.960 --> 00:20:42.920
Uh-huh!

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:45.130
Yeah, you're right...

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:46.670
Sorry for freaking out on you.

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:49.210
No problem! I'm glad you told us.

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:51.500
Your worries are our worries.

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:52.750
There you have it!

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:54.290
Well, shall we get going?

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:55.170
Yeah!

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:57.290
Thank you very much!

00:20:57.290 --> 00:21:00.380
Sweet! Excellent! Unstoppable!

00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:07.290
CHU2-sama!

00:21:07.290 --> 00:21:08.130
Wha-?!

00:21:09.420 --> 00:21:10.580
Sorry I'm late!

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:12.210
C'mon, hurry up!

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:19.290
PAREO!

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:20.290
Right away!

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:23.750
1st place is...

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:28.040
Roselia! We did it!

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:29.250
Seriously?! 1st place?!
Roselia! We did it!

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:29.880
Seriously?! 1st place?!

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:32.000
We did it, Rin-Rin!

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:32.540
Yeah!

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:34.500
Yukina, Sayo! We got 1st!

00:21:34.500 --> 00:21:35.790
So it would seem.

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:37.330
Aren't you excited?!

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:39.080
Of course. However...

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:40.710
This means...

00:21:41.130 --> 00:21:42.170
For real...?

00:21:42.170 --> 00:21:43.380
Arisa-chan...

00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:44.920
How did we do?

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:45.960
Let's see...

00:21:46.420 --> 00:21:47.960
Wha-? You're kidding me!

00:21:47.960 --> 00:21:49.080
Arisa...?

00:21:49.880 --> 00:21:51.290
We got 2nd place!

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:53.080
What?!

00:21:56.170 --> 00:22:08.080
What will you treasure when we
blast through the ceiling of our dreams?

00:22:10.210 --> 00:22:12.380
La la la la la la...

00:22:12.540 --> 00:22:14.750
La la la la la la...

00:22:14.960 --> 00:22:17.080
La la la la la la...

00:22:17.080 --> 00:22:19.170
La la la...

00:22:19.170 --> 00:22:23.880
Always laughing and joking as I chased after

00:22:23.880 --> 00:22:28.330
Pieces of that faintly glowing dream

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:33.290
I gathered them up and tried sticking them together

00:22:33.290 --> 00:22:38.580
To form a bright, shining star

00:22:38.580 --> 00:22:43.540
Sparkling memories held tight to my chest

00:22:43.540 --> 00:22:48.420
I smile fondly as I watch you take a step forward

00:22:48.420 --> 00:22:49.080
So I...

00:22:49.080 --> 00:22:53.790
Want to stay with you forever, more than anyone else

00:22:53.790 --> 00:22:58.540
Let's sing the rest together on the count of three

00:22:58.540 --> 00:23:02.210
I can't contain myself any longer...

00:23:02.210 --> 00:23:03.130
"Here we go!"

00:23:03.130 --> 00:23:08.040
In the blue sky above, yes! BanG! Dream! (Blast through)

00:23:08.040 --> 00:23:12.880
A song of courage sways in the wind (Our dreams!)

00:23:12.880 --> 00:23:22.130
Tying you to the stage of our dreams with its melody

00:23:35.420 --> 00:23:37.830
Next Time: Somethin' in Common with PoPiPa!
